        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The property is situated on Mill Road, Corbally, Limerick. The Mill Road is one of Limerick’s premier residential addresses. \r\n \r\nCorbally is well served by an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools, neighbourhood shops, cafés, sporting facilities and scenic riverside walks along the nearby River Shannon.\r\n\r\nLimerick City Centre is just a short drive away, providing access to an extensive range of retail, dining, educational and employment facilities, including the University of Limerick, Technological University of the Shannon and several major business and healthcare hubs. The area is also well connected by public transport routes and road networks, with straightforward access to the M7 motorway and wider Mid-West region."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Residential site with full planning granted for construction of a detached two storey dwelling house, a detached domestic garage and associated site works at Laurel Lodge, Mill Road, Corbally, Limerick.\r\n \r\nPlanning was granted under Planning No. 25/61060. There are 7 conditions attached and details of same can be forwarded to any enquirers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: Exempt"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Travel from Limerick City towards Corbally via the R463 road. Turn left onto Mill Road after passing O’Driscoll’s Bar. Continue along Mill Road and the property is located towards the end of the road on the right-hand side, identified by a “For Sale” sign."
      },
